WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.422
Shockable rhythms.

00:00:01.422 --> 00:00:08.136
Ventricular fibrillation and pulseless ventricular tachycardia are shockable rhythms.

00:00:08.136 --> 00:00:23.777
The supplied sources report that survival from VF falls by about 7–10% for each minute treatment is delayed; untreated VF can deteriorate to asystole, which is not shockable and is managed with CPR.
